# {{Internet slang}} {{alternative spelling of|LOL}}[[Category:Internet laughter slang]]
====Usage notes====
The final {{term||Z}} serves only to make the acronym look like a plural noun, or, more commonly, as a mockery of those who use {{term|-z|z}} to pluralize other nouns, as opposed to {{term|-s|s}}. The mockery of such people is often not done in any kind of specific context, but usually as a way to lighten up a conversation.

